{"page":54,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:30","surah":3,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تَجِدُ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّا عَمِلَتْ مِنْ خَيْرٍ مُّحْضَرًا وَمَا عَمِلَتْ مِن سُوٓءٍ تَوَدُّ لَوْ أَنَّ بَيْنَهَا وَبَيْنَهُۥٓ أَمَدًۢا بَعِيدًا ۗ وَيُحَذِّرُكُمُ ٱللَّهُ نَفْسَهُۥ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ رَءُوفٌۢ بِٱلْعِبَادِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when every soul finds all the good it has done present before it, it will wish all the bad it has done to be far, far away. God warns you to beware of Him, but God is compassionate towards His servants.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(On the) day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَجِدُ","en_gloss":"will find","transliteration":"tajidu","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَمِلَتْ","en_gloss":"it did","transliteration":"ʿamilat","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَيْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"good ","transliteration":"khayrin","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّحْضَرًۭا","en_gloss":"presented","transliteration":"muḥ'ḍaran","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَمِلَتْ","en_gloss":"it did","transliteration":"ʿamilat","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سُوٓءٍۢ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sūin","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَوَدُّ","en_gloss":"it will wish","transliteration":"tawaddu","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"[if]","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"3:30"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ب